  "title": "Beef Heart Stew",
  "description": "This is a very tasty beef heart stew that came from Nova Scotia in the '60s. Beef heart is browned, then cooked with onions to make a tasty stew that goes great over noodles or mashed potatoes.",
  "authors": [
    "J. Murphy"
